    507  57b3							; What SPACE and the keytar's buttons do (menu: SPACE, ... BUTTON):
    508  57b3							;   held     MUTE, BEND DOWN, BEND UP, VIBRATO, TREMOLO, ARP, STUTTER,
    509  57b3							;	      VINYL STOP, GLIDE, SUSTAIN, OCTAVE UP, REPEAT, FILTER SWEEP,
